      "side": 1,
      "message": "Yeah, this is due to the files being structured for pvmfw (around `main.rs`) but the `rust_test` using `dice.rs` as the \"main\" file. As a result, while pvmfw builds are happy with\n```\nsrc/\n    main.rs\n    dice.rs\n    dice/\n        chain.rs\n```\n`libpvmfw.dice.test` builds get confused as `mod chain` makes them expect\n```\nsrc/\n    dice.rs\n    chain.rs\n```\n\nI\u0027ve addressed this by moving `dice.rs` to `dice/mod.rs`, so that both builds are happy because the latter now sees\n```\nsrc/dice/\n    mod.rs\n    chain.rs\n```",
